TESTSUITE "Arithmetic with a zero operand in parentheses"

TESTCASE "a zero discount leaves the premium unchanged"
    MOVE 100 TO WS-PREMIUM
    MOVE 0 TO WS-DISCOUNT
    PERFORM CALC-PARA
    EXPECT WS-NET TO BE 100
    EXPECT WS-LOADED TO BE 100
    EXPECT WS-RECIPROCAL TO BE 200

TESTCASE "a nonzero discount is applied"
    MOVE 100 TO WS-PREMIUM
    MOVE 0.1 TO WS-DISCOUNT
    PERFORM CALC-PARA
    EXPECT WS-NET TO BE 90
    EXPECT WS-LOADED TO BE 110
    EXPECT WS-RECIPROCAL TO BE 190
